{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565970/extras/7eb7a878f2e9b5a69f05a239b883ae58.avif?t=1762549101\" width=1560 height=595 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Love Sudoku?</strong> <strong>LOVE HENTAI? Us Too! :)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve 25 Sudoku puzzles to uncover pieces of stunning hentai artwork to browse in a gallery as your reward! Each Sudoku puzzle features unique hand-crafted XXX artwork to discover and savor with each one you solve!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25 Sudoku Puzzles Each with Unique XXX Artwork</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Art Gallery to Browse and Zoom-In on Completed Artwork</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One-Handed Controls ;)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565970/extras/91ce02bd5c37cc211ff4b71587dbf070.avif?t=1762549101\" width=477 height=486 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand Crafted Hentai Artwork By Professional Artists!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No AI-slop in this Hentai game! Every illustration was lovingly crafted by professional hentai artists for your enjoyment! Featured artists include, but not limited to: MLeth, TheInsaneum, and Wintonn Kidd.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2b50\u2b50\u2b50</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565970/extras/b0d733dab19a0be6b453f1ff871c39e3.poster.avif?t=1762549101\" width=546 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565970/extras/b0d733dab19a0be6b453f1ff871c39e3.webm?t=1762549101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2b50\u2b50\u2b50</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100% Of Proceeds Go To Charity!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This was a project of passion for us as a push-back against poorly made AI-Generated porn games and a project for friends to come together. We want to encourage the artistry and hard work of real artists as well as the legitmacy and importance of sex work, including pornography artists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As such, all sales from this game will go to <strong>Sex Workers Outreach Project (SWOP)</strong>, a 501(c)(3) non-profit organization that advocates for the rights of sex workers and trafficking victims</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;SWOP Behind Bars (SBB) is a national grassroots social justice network dedicated to the fundamental human rights of sex workers, victims of trafficking, and their communities. We focus on those currently incarcerated or seeking re-entry. SWOP BB centers the voices of sex workers and trafficking victims as we work to end violence and stigma by providing direct services, resources, community-building projects, educational programs, and advocacy.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565970/